-- SHADOW-SEMANTICS cell I16's CONTROL, graded as its own row: the chain hop removed,
-- `ifc` imported directly. Same interface, same impl, same standalone, same receiver --
-- so the two rows must print the same number. On the silent axis this pair is the whole
-- test: neither file can fail loudly, so only their agreement plus the pinned value can
-- detect a chain that changed the program's meaning.
import ifc.{Sizeable}
import fmod.{size}

main = println (size "abc")
